OL,3,GNEWSAManchester Half Marathon: What you
OL,4,Aneed to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of runners will take on
OL,7,Fthe Manchester Half Marathon on Sunday.
OL,9,FSome 32,000 people have signed up for
OL,10,Fthe event, which will see them complete
OL,11,F13.1 miles (21km) on mainly flat roads
OL,12,Fthrough Trafford and south Manchester.
OL,14,FSince the event started 10 years ago,
OL,15,Fparticipant numbers have nearly
OL,16,Ftrebled.
OL,18,FOrganisers said about #1.5m was raised
OL,19,Flast year for national and local
OL,20,Fcharities. Here is everything you need
OL,21,Fto know ahead of Sunday's big race.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
